{"id":"vod_md_5741","vodId":"5741","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"暗杀教室第二季","name_cn":"暗杀教室第二季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231011-1/c597d86d03cce7cec05950da21cb55da.jpg"},"summary":"经过南国小岛上和鹰冈的决斗，3年E班的各位与杀老师（福山润 配音）的关系进一步拉近。虽然暗杀活动仍在继续，然而这似乎已经变成了师生之间互动玩乐的重要环节。以茅野枫（洲崎绫 配音）为代表的学生们又开始策划更加精彩的暗杀陷阱。除此之外，他们帮助比琪老师（伊藤静 配音）追求乌间惟臣（杉田智和 配音），又或者磨刀霍霍与A班的精英们展开荣誉与尊严之战。与此同时，白先生带领堀部系成（绪方惠美 配音）卷土重来，而神秘的死神则将E班推向各位凶险的境地。随着最后期限一天天逼近，杀老师和学生们的关系变得愈加微妙……本片根据松井优征的超人气漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-11 07:42:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/BCypuYbg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/VBdUUty7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/esEG07zc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/Aib22Ips/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/K5pjOoEJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/jVj3ITxL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/mNeprJlQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/48UpxgDc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/ZjBD2G0S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/vxCZIjzb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/GDTQrhti/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/19RjtxsQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/02C4Zquu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/ukiSJiOt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/HInno11n/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"ht